    <title>科技爱好者周刊（第 411 期）：OpenClaw 2.0 是一个缩影</title>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="http://www.ruanyifeng.com/blog/2026/09/weekly-issue-411.html" />
    <id>tag:www.ruanyifeng.com,2026:/blog//1.2555</id>

    <published>2026-09-03T23:59:05Z</published>
    <updated>2026-09-18T02:55:48Z</updated>

    <summary>这里记录每周值得分享的科技内容，周五发布。...</summary>
    <author>
        <name>阮一峰</name>
        <uri>http://www.ruanyifeng.com</uri>
    </author>
    
        <category term="Weekly" scheme="http://www.sixapart.com/ns/types#category" />
    
    
